sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as API
    participant P as Payment Provider

    C->>API: POST /charge
    API->>P: charge()
    P-->>API: 503
    Note over API: wait 1.2s (base + jitter)
    API->>P: retry 1
    P-->>API: 503
    Note over API: wait 2.7s (base + jitter)
    API->>P: retry 2
    P-->>API: 200 OK
    API-->>C: 200 OK
